Arabic, Egyptian Arabic, and Persian.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:11.400
Hi, Steve Kaufmann here to talk about
shadowing, a language learning technique.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.360
Uh, remember if you enjoy these
